# Base flavor package list for the official OpenWrt ImageBuilder (25.12.5).
#
# The ImageBuilder already includes the OpenWrt default router package set
# (base-files, dnsmasq, firewall4, dropbear, odhcp6c, odhcpd-ipv6only, ppp,
# ppp-mod-pppoe, wpad-basic-mbedtls, ...) plus this device profile's
# DEVICE_PACKAGES (kmod-mt7603, kmod-mt7615-firmware).
# Listed here is ONLY what the defaults lack. One package per line; # comments.
#
# Everything here must resolve from the official precompiled 25.12.5 feeds —
# the ImageBuilder pipeline never compiles from source.

luci
